|first appearance = '''EoC''': [[Maldives (Empire of Cats)/Outbreak|Chapter 1 - Maldives/Tokushima Outbreak]]<br>'''SoL''': [[Revenant Road|Sub-Chapter 34 - Revenant Road]]<br>'''ItF''': [[Korea (Into the Future)/Outbreak|Chapter 1 - Korea Outbreak]]<br>'''Aku Realms''': [[Cambodia (Aku Realm)|Cambodia/Miyazaki]]<br>'''CotC''': [[Venus (Cats of the Cosmos)/Outbreak|Chapter 1 - Venus Outbreak]]
