|Transl1 (JP) = Just a pig (female) wearing a royal skull.<br>Tried to take advantage of a trend and age herself,<br>but failed tragically. Her catchphrase is<br>"What's decaying is the most desirable."
|Name1 (TW) = 不死豬野郎
|Desc1 (TW) = 只是一隻戴上王室骷髏的豬(母的)<br>跟隨潮流挑戰讓自己熟成的結果卻失敗。<br>這樣的她有著個人口頭禪<br>「半生不熟尚介讚」
|Name1 (KR) = 돈비
