==Trivia==
*Zigge's Japanese name, Tonshī (トンシー), may be derived from 豚脂 ''tonshi'' (lard; fat from a pig's abdomen), 頓死 ''tonshi'' (sudden death) and キョンシー ''kyonshī'' ([[wikipedia:Jiangshi|Jiangshi]], a Chinese hopping vampire/zombie). The Jiangshi connection is supported by how she attacks by bouncing up and down, although unlike Jiangshi, it's not the only way she can move.
*Although Zigge's Japanese description says she failed tragically when she tried to age herself for a trend, she's still proud of her new look. The おいしい ''oishii'' part of her catchphrase (腐りかけが一番おいしい ''kusari kake ga ichiban oishii'', lit. "what's in the midst of decaying/about to decay is the tastiest") means "tasty", but is also slang for "physically/sexually attractive" or "desirable".

